<BaseLayout title="Register | Healing the Heart">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-inner"><p class="eyebrow">Take your next step</p><h1>Registration</h1><p>When registration is open, this is where you will begin.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="rich-section"><div class="placeholder"><strong>Registration is being connected.</strong><br />The live registration form, current class selection, and confirmed class information will be added here. No dates, prices, or availability are being assumed.</div><h2 style="margin-top:4rem">Not ready to register?</h2><p>That's okay. You can first learn about the journey or what to expect, and you are welcome to ask questions.</p><div class="actions left"><a class="button primary" href="/journey">Explore the journey</a><a class="button outline" href="/contact">Contact us</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
